more masculine things in life, cars, fishing and action movies. While Belinda had been a little unsure about leaving Jaden alone with Greg to begin with, over the past couple of months, Greg had looked after the toddler ten or so times and proven himself to be a reliable care She therefore agreed that Greg could take Jaden for a few hours, as long as he dropped him off at her sister, Katie's house, later that evening. Belinda and Katie had been invited to a friend's birthday party in the neighbouring town of Trourohagen, and they'd organised a babysitter to watch all four of their children at Katie's house, which was just over a kilometre away from Belinda's. Greg happily agreed.

