at Katie's to check that everything was okay there. She then fell straight to sleep in front of the lounge room heater. Belinda told the police that about an hour and a half later she awoke to Greg shaking her in a clear state of distress. Jaden's not in the hospital, he said. I lied to you. We have to go to the police. He's been abducted. Belinda almost started to laugh, thinking it was another one of Greg's twisted jokes. But when Greg started crying and apologising, she realised he wasn't kidding. Greg said that Jaden really had been asleep on the couch, and he'd only made up the story

